 in A the outer thin line has the right-arm gap and the inner thin star has the left-arm gap, other lines closed. B swaps only lines 1-2, D swaps only lines 3-4, C puts the outer gap on the left, E moves the gaps to lines 3 and 4. Thick/thin star strokes drawn as 3 and 1.5 (rectangles 4 and 2) to keep the thick/thin difference readable."}